{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2023-03-02 16:30:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC ANNOUNCES CASH DIVIDEND FOR FOURTH QUARTER OF FISCAL YEAR 2023', 'text': 'DUBLIN , MARCH 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF MEDTRONIC PLC (NYSE:MDT) ON\xa0THURSDAY, MARCH 2, 2023, APPROVED THE FISCAL YEAR 2023 FOURTH QUARTER CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.68\xa0PER ORDINARY SHARE, REPRESENTING AN 8% INCREASE OVER THE PRIOR YEAR. THIS QUARTERLY DECLARATION IS CONSISTENT WITH THE DIVIDEND ANNOUNCEMENT MADE BY THE COMPANY IN\xa0MAY 2022.'}